<item rdf:about="http://www.hdtvmagazine.com/test/2007/08/displaysearch_r_1.php">
<title>LCD TV Panels Enjoyed Record Quarter in Q2&apos;07, Doubled Up on PDPs at 40&quot;+ as Plasma Sales Remained Weak</title>
<link>http://www.hdtvmagazine.com/test/2007/08/displaysearch_r_1.php</link>
<description><![CDATA[<p><html xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40"></p>

<p><head><br />
