<item rdf:about="http://www.hdtvmagazine.com/test/2006/05/imagine_this.php">
<title>Imagine This</title>
<link>http://www.hdtvmagazine.com/test/2006/05/imagine_this.php</link>
<description><![CDATA[<p>When thinking through the Sony proposal consider that we can do articles with embedded video. </p>

<p>Imagine this as a unique ad made for our site.</p>

<p><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/ti62jvSTM3Q"></param><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/ti62jvSTM3Q" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="425" height="350"></embed></object></p>]]></description>
<dc:subject></dc:subject>
<dc:creator>Dale Cripps</dc:creator>
